cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LocalGovBench, please cite this software artifact."
type: software
title: LocalGovBench
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-06-04"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Open research artifact (v0.1.0) providing a structured framework, checklist,
  and maturity scoring for assessing governance of local and on-premise large
  language model deployments in European public sector organizations. Includes
  indicative EU AI Act and GDPR theme mappings, a Governance Readiness
  Benchmark (GRB) experiment, synthetic validation tooling, and reproducibility
  scripts. Empirical field validation is pending.
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - large language models
  - governance
  - public sector
  - European Union
  - AI Act
  - GDPR
  - on-premise
  - benchmark
  - reproducibility
